          <list rend="bulleted">
            <item>Some registration numbers have a blank or illegible occupation field</item>
            <item>Sometimes there are gaps in the data</item>
            <item>Some entries appear to have a mismatch between the given name and the printed gender code — these have been corrected where a clear judgement can be made. This includes entries where female name and occupation (e.g. tailoress) is listed as M.</item>
